{"id":"1b58072624bb3091","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyEraseRow.md","title":"PolyEraseRow","display":"PolyEraseRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyEraseRow","parameters":["z2224","z2225","z2226"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyEraseRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z2224</span><span>z2225</span><span>z2226</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>z2224</code>、<code>z2225</code>、<code>z2226</code>。</p>\n<p>擦去全部类型注解、类型抽象与类型应用；项变量绑定保持。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyEraseRow z2224 z2225 z2226)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (exists u\n    (and\n      (@ Pair t u z2226)\n      (and\n        (@ PolyAny t)\n        (and\n          (@ URaw u)\n          (or\n            (exists z2229 (and (@ TVar z2229 t) (= t u)))\n            (or\n              (exists z2230\n                (exists z2231\n                  (exists z2232\n                    (and\n                      (@ TLam z2230 z2231 t)\n                      (and\n                        (@ ULam z2232 u)\n                        (exists z2237\n                          (exists z2238 (and (in z2237 z2225) (and (@ App z2224 z2237 z2238) (@ Pair z2231 z2232 z2238))))))))))\n              (or\n                (exists z2233\n                  (exists z2234\n                    (exists z2235\n                      (exists z2236\n                        (and\n                          (@ TApp z2233 z2234 t)\n                          (and\n                            (@ TApp z2235 z2236 u)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z2239\n                            (exists z2240 (and (in z2239 z2225) (and (@ App z2224 z2239 z2240) (@ Pair z2233 z2235 z2240)))))\n                            (exists z2241\n                            (exists z2242 (and (in z2241 z2225) (and (@ App z2224 z2241 z2242) (@ Pair z2234 z2236 z2242))))))))))))\n                (or\n                  (exists z2230\n                    (and\n                      (@ FTAbs z2230 t)\n                      (exists z2243\n                        (exists z2244 (and (in z2243 z2225) (and (@ App z2224 z2243 z2244) (@ Pair z2230 u z2244)))))))\n                  (exists z2230\n                    (exists z2231\n                      (and\n                        (@ FTInst z2230 z2231 t)\n                        (exists z2245\n                          (exists z2246 (and (in z2245 z2225) (and (@ App z2224 z2245 z2246) (@ Pair z2230 u z2246)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1b540c729aaa0e46\" href=\"?note=1b540c729aaa0e46\" title=\"ZFC_FTAbs\">FTAbs</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"acb0218f5d2e90af\" href=\"?note=acb0218f5d2e90af\" title=\"ZFC_FTInst\">FTInst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ace28f20094de6e2\" href=\"?note=ace28f20094de6e2\" title=\"ZFC_PolyAny\">PolyAny</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"fad087c9d77463a6\" href=\"?note=fad087c9d77463a6\" title=\"ZFC_URaw\">URaw</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyEraseRow z2224 z2225 z2226)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTAbs|FTAbs]]；[[ZFC_FTInst|FTInst]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyAny|PolyAny]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]；[[ZFC_URaw|URaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTAbs","status":"resolved","id":"1b540c729aaa0e46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTAbs|FTAbs]]；[[ZFC_FTInst|FTInst]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyAny|PolyAny]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]；[[ZFC_ULam|ULam]]；[[ZFC_URaw|URaw]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FTInst","status":"resolved","id":"acb0218f5d2e90af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_FTAbs|FTAbs]]；[[ZFC_FTInst|FTInst]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_PolyAny|Poly